+# Source-side probe skeleton
+
+Probes in this directory run against the TypeScript source repository
+(`/input/source`) and document the behavior of the in-scope modules. They are
+created by later authoring batches; `BATCH-SKELETON-0001` only reserves the
+directory.
+
+## Conventions
+
+- Reuse the timeout helpers in `shared/skeleton/timeout.sh`; never invoke a
+  potentially long-running command without an explicit `timeout`.
+- The repository's own suite is run as `npm test` (`tsx --test
+  tests/**/*.test.ts`); wrap it with an explicit timeout and never let it wait
+  indefinitely.
+- Source probes establish the F2P/DIFF baseline and MUST be executed against the
+  real source tree before a result is declared PASS.
